# Ball_Bomb - the ball is a round black bomb: a metal collar at the top-right, a short fuse, a spark.
# Ball family structure (see Ball_Basic.paint) on a blue-black body; the collar, fuse and spark are the only
# parts that leave the family circle.
size 32 32
key
  K #05060c  ink (outer line)
  M #2c3048  bomb body (icons.json color)
  s #1d2034  shadow
  S #12142a  core shadow
  R #3e4570  reflected light, lit outline, collar light
  H #d4daf6  highlight
  F #b08850  fuse cord
  Y #ffd040  spark
  O #ff7a30  spark tips (icons.json glowColor)
  W #fffbe0  spark core
strokes
  ellipse K 16 16 14.8 14.8
# the collar: a short cylinder pointing up-right, sunk 2 px into the ball (its base line is inside the rim)
draft at 20 0
  ............
  ............
  ....K.......
  ...K.K......
  ..K...K.....
  ...K...K....
  ....K...K...
  .....K...K..
  ......K.K...
  .......K....
seeds
  M 16 16
  M 24 3 23 4
ops
  band M s 1 1 7
  band M S 1 1 3
  band M R 1 1 1
# collar shading across its axis: lit top-left side, dark bottom-right side; the ball rim under it is repainted
shade at 23 3
  .R....
  RRM...
  .MMM..
  ..MMs.
  ...sss
  ....ss
shade at 27 1
  ...Y.
  ..YWY
  .FYY.
  F....
ops
  px O 28 1 30 3
shade at 6 5
  ....HH
  ..HHHH
  .HHHH.
  .HH...
ops
  edge K R -1 -1
  px R 2 19 19 2
  px K 3 23
